I was getting mad that all the security tools that meant to guard your agents are not local and those who are, just cost a fortune.&lt;p&gt;So I’ve built Weir. You can watch you sensitive data flow, your traces and your egress tools calls.&lt;p&gt;It doesn’t stop your ADLC, it only watch it locally (no egress).&lt;p&gt;The agents you use - I’ve set a Claude code hook that stripe your known keys from tool output before the model sees them.&lt;p&gt;The agents you build - Weir plants fake keys, runs your agents flows and report every place they leaked (traces, logs, model, services). It helped me find CVE-2026-116691 in MLFlow.&lt;p&gt;Would be super happy to know what you guys think!&lt;/p&gt;
